      "writtenOn": "2022-05-31T21:33:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like you could emit the \"caused by\" error here:\n\n  if (!check_valid_uniform_type(...)) {\n     if (baseType-\u003eisInterfaceBlock() || baseType-\u003eisStruct()) {\n       context.fErrors-\u003eerror(pos, \"caused by:\");\n     }\n  }\n  \nIf that works, you could remove `level` from `check_valid_uniform_type` entirely.",
