      "message": "Just noticed: all interface blocks are structs in SkSL. `isStruct` is always sufficient.",
      "parentUuid": "1c5f7fce_a19068b1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 138,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 138,
